1
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,000
[Shaiapouf] Damn it. Almost.

2
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:13,000
[laughs]

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,000
It didn't take long
for the poison to kick in.

4
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:20,000
[Killua] What's going on?

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,000
He wasn't aiming for me,

6
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,000
which has to mean
he was aiming for the woman.

7
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:09,000
[singer singing in English]

8
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:11,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

9
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:15,000
[singer singing in English]

10
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:17,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

11
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:02,000
[dramatic music playing]

12
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:17,000
[Knuckle] He's back.

13
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:50,000
Hey, uh, aren't we all too close?

14
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:04,000
Should I remove A.P.R. from Pouf

15
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:07,000
and then turn around
and go after the King?

16
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:28,000
Hurry. Hurry!

17
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:31,000
-[segment] Hurry.
-Hurry.

18
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:32,000
-Hurry. Hurry.
-Hurry.

19
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:33,000
-Faster.
-Faster.

20
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:35,000
-Faster.
-Faster. Faster. Faster.

21
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:43,000
[Shaiapouf] There it is.
Come on. Hide it fast!

22
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:45,000
-[segment] Hurry.
-Hurry.

23
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:46,000
Faster.

24
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:48,000
-Faster.
-Faster!

25
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:50,000
-Faster. Faster.
-Faster.

26
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:51,000
-Hurry. Hurry.
-Faster.

27
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:53,000
-Hurry.
-Faster. Faster.

28
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:05,000
[Ikalgo] Hmm.

29
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:10,000
These two won't work.
They're way too mangled.

30
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:14,000
They'd make absolutely
terrible living dead dolls.

31
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:25,000
The King is at the palace's entrance.

32
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:27,000
-Yeah.
-We should go and circle around the wall

33
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:30,000
and hide ourselves among the crowd.

34
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:31,000
[Killua] Okay.

35
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:35,000
How 'bout Gon and Pitou?

36
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:36,000
Hold on.

37
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:47,000
So I'm curious.
How does that crystal work?

38
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:49,000
Do you see Pouf and me in it, too?

39
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:52,000
Yes. I have a bird's-eye view of you.

40
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:57,000
When I look at someone
with just my right eye,

41
00:04:57,000 --> 00:05:00,000
my Wink Blue registers them
on the crystal.

42
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:03,000
After that, I can monitor them
anytime I like

43
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:05,000
by looking with just my left.

44
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:35,000
And I can only use my power
to watch three people at one time.

45
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:39,000
If I see someone else
with only my right eye,

46
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:42,000
I won't be able to see
the oldest of the three targets,

47
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:44,000
which, in this case, is Pouf.

48
00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:53,000
and if you can only see his main body,

49
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:56,000
well, it's probably more
of a hindrance than a help.

50
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:09,000
And if his main body
is only the size of a fly,

51
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:18,000
Our only chance to defeat Pouf
is while he's divided.

52
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:21,000
Doesn't sound like
a disadvantage to me.

53
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:08,000
[wind blowing]

54
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:17,000
Now walk forward.

55
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:56,000
[cell phone buzzing]

56
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:00,000
[beeps]

57
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:04,000
[narrator] Noises echoed
throughout the old castle,

58
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:14,000
on the cell phone hidden in a pocket.

59
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:18,000
[Welfin] Sir Pitou, this is Welfin.

60
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:22,000
I'll try to keep this as brief as I can.

61
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:31,000
[Welfin] There are still intruders
all over the place,

62
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:34,000
so we're taking refuge
underneath the palace.

63
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:37,000
I'll let you hear her voice.

64
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:40,000
[latch clanks]

65
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:27,000
[groans]

66
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:39,000
[Shaiapouf] Since I can split myself
at the cellular level,

67
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:43,000
it's also possible for me
to become different people.

68
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:47,000
I can replicate faces,
bodies, even voices.

69
00:09:57,000 --> 00:10:00,000
that will release him
from the curse of that girl.

70
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:05,000
So you should just keep watching
Gon and Pitou.

71
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:14,000
[latch clanks]

72
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:21,000
[tense music playing]

73
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:58,000
[wind blowing]

74
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:15,000
Now I want you to heal Kite
like you said you would.

75
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:30,000
[Neferpitou] Your name.

76
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:34,000
What did you say your name was?

77
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:39,000
Gon. It's Gon Freecss.

78
00:11:51,000 --> 00:11:52,000
I owe you that.

79
00:11:56,000 --> 00:11:58,000
This man…

80
00:12:47,000 --> 00:12:50,000
[thud echoing]

81
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:06,000
[Neferpitou] Gon, the truth is

82
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:07,000
he died during our fight.

83
00:13:29,000 --> 00:13:31,000
[shuddering]

84
00:13:35,000 --> 00:13:39,000
I can't bring back the dead,
no matter what.

85
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:42,000
My ability has limits.

86
00:13:43,000 --> 00:13:46,000
It can only prevent the body
from decomposing

87
00:13:47,000 --> 00:13:49,000
and control its movements.

88
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:53,000
[sobbing]

89
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:03,000
[Neferpitou] His soul isn't here,
not anymore,

90
00:14:03,000 --> 00:14:05,000
and I can't bring him back.

91
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:07,000
Your friend is gone.

92
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:17,000
I'm sorry.

93
00:14:55,000 --> 00:14:56,000
Thanks a lot.

94
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:57,000
[gasps]

95
00:14:58,000 --> 00:14:59,000
[sighs]

96
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:03,000
What is this?
Where did that come from?

97
00:15:03,000 --> 00:15:05,000
Why are you thanking me?

98
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:12,000
Oh, drop it, already.

99
00:15:12,000 --> 00:15:14,000
Stuff just means stuff, okay?

100
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:16,000
What was that all about?

101
00:15:16,000 --> 00:15:20,000
Making me angry is an interesting way
of showing me your gratitude.

102
00:15:21,000 --> 00:15:23,000
Don't worry about it.

103
00:15:23,000 --> 00:15:24,000
That was the last time.

104
00:15:26,000 --> 00:15:27,000
[groans]

105
00:15:29,000 --> 00:15:30,000
Because we're friends.

106
00:15:31,000 --> 00:15:32,000
[gasps]

107
00:15:32,000 --> 00:15:33,000
I don't say thanks,

108
00:15:34,000 --> 00:15:35,000
not to my friends.

109
00:15:43,000 --> 00:15:44,000
I nearly forgot.

110
00:15:45,000 --> 00:15:47,000
[gasps]

111
00:15:53,000 --> 00:15:55,000
What is going on here?

112
00:15:55,000 --> 00:15:57,000
[gasps]

113
00:16:07,000 --> 00:16:08,000
Oh, Kite.

114
00:16:32,000 --> 00:16:34,000
And now I've got this
pointless kill to my credit.

115
00:16:35,000 --> 00:16:38,000
You sure have grown up, Gon.

116
00:16:38,000 --> 00:16:41,000
[dramatic music playing]

117
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:43,000
It's me.

118
00:16:46,000 --> 00:16:47,000
I did this.

119
00:16:49,000 --> 00:16:50,000
From here on out,

120
00:16:52,000 --> 00:16:54,000
in victory or defeat, it'll be hell.

121
00:16:58,000 --> 00:17:01,000
[Gon] If I just hadn't gone with him…

122
00:17:03,000 --> 00:17:06,000
Kite would still be alive.

123
00:17:08,000 --> 00:17:10,000
[dramatic music playing]

124
00:17:11,000 --> 00:17:12,000
[imperceptible]

125
00:17:24,000 --> 00:17:25,000
It was…

126
00:17:27,000 --> 00:17:29,000
it was all my fault.

127
00:17:29,000 --> 00:17:32,000
[dramatic music playing]

128
00:17:32,000 --> 00:17:33,000
[imperceptible]

129
00:17:51,000 --> 00:17:53,000
If I hadn't followed him,

130
00:17:54,000 --> 00:17:56,000
none of this would have happened.

131
00:17:59,000 --> 00:18:03,000
It really was all my fault.

132
00:18:14,000 --> 00:18:17,000
So it's all my fault that now Kite is…

133
00:18:30,000 --> 00:18:32,000
But it was me.

134
00:18:32,000 --> 00:18:35,000
It was… It was all me.

135
00:18:40,000 --> 00:18:42,000
I killed Kite. It was all my fault.

136
00:18:45,000 --> 00:18:47,000
All of this is my fault.

137
00:18:49,000 --> 00:18:51,000
No! It's Pitou's fault!

138
00:19:02,000 --> 00:19:05,000
He would never be beaten,
not by something like that.

139
00:19:07,000 --> 00:19:08,000
Kite is dead now.

140
00:19:10,000 --> 00:19:12,000
Kite is dead now.

141
00:19:12,000 --> 00:19:14,000
Kite is dead now.

142
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:17,000
Kite is dead now.

143
00:19:17,000 --> 00:19:19,000
Kite is dead now!

144
00:19:21,000 --> 00:19:22,000
Somebody help me.

145
00:19:24,000 --> 00:19:26,000
Please, anybody, help me,

146
00:19:26,000 --> 00:19:29,000
because Kite is… Because he is…

147
00:19:37,000 --> 00:19:39,000
I'll fix you. I promise.

148
00:19:41,000 --> 00:19:43,000
[shuddering]

149
00:20:19,000 --> 00:20:21,000
[Neferpitou] Dr. Blythe.

150
00:20:25,000 --> 00:20:27,000
[sighs]

151
00:20:28,000 --> 00:20:29,000
Huh?

152
00:20:30,000 --> 00:20:31,000
What's going on?

153
00:20:31,000 --> 00:20:34,000
Is Pitou going to help Kite?

154
00:20:37,000 --> 00:20:41,000
Of course. Kite was never dead.

155
00:21:03,000 --> 00:21:07,000
Please, you can do that
after you finish healing Kite.

156
00:21:20,000 --> 00:21:23,000
but something is wrong with Gon.

157
00:21:23,000 --> 00:21:25,000
[Killua] What is it? What's wrong?

158
00:21:25,000 --> 00:21:27,000
Kite is not being healed,

159
00:21:27,000 --> 00:21:29,000
but it appears that Pitou is instead.

160
00:21:29,000 --> 00:21:30,000
[gasps]

161
00:21:30,000 --> 00:21:33,000
Gon is slumped over
on the floor next to Pitou.

162
00:21:46,000 --> 00:21:49,000
[laughing]

163
00:22:03,000 --> 00:22:05,000
[Gon] Please…

164
00:22:06,000 --> 00:22:07,000
help Kite.

165
00:22:07,000 --> 00:22:09,000
[closing theme music playing]

166
00:22:10,000 --> 00:22:13,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

167
00:23:28,000 --> 00:23:30,000
[upbeat music playing]

168
00:23:30,000 --> 00:23:32,000
[Gon] Next time, "Anger and Light."

169
00:23:32,000 --> 00:23:34,000
[Killua] Hold on until I get there.

170
00:23:35,000 --> 00:23:37,000
[Gon] I don't care if this is the end.

171
00:23:37,000 --> 00:23:39,000
I'm gonna kill you, Pitou!

172
00:23:40,000 --> 00:23:41,000
[Killua] Gon! No!
